sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest as Guest buyer
    participant Web as Web (order-status page)
    participant Auth as auth.deps
    participant API as reviews.routes
    participant Svc as reviews.service
    participant DB as Postgres

    note over Guest,Web: Guest lands on /orders/{orderId}?email=... (no account, no Bearer token)
    Web->>Auth: mintGuestToken(email)
    Auth-->>Web: Guest JWT (kind="guest", email_hash claim)

    Web->>API: GET /reviews/eligibility?order_id={id}<br/>Authorization: Guest {jwt}<br/>X-Guest-Email: {email}
    API->>Auth: resolve_request_actor(request, db)
    Auth->>Auth: verify Guest JWT + email_hash(X-Guest-Email) == claims.email_hash
    Auth-->>API: RequestActor(user_id=None, guest_email=email)
    API->>Svc: review_eligibility(order_id, user_id=None, guest_email=email)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT order WHERE id=? (owner check: order.guest_email == actor email)
    Svc->>DB: first brand of order + already-reviewed check
    Svc-->>API: (brand_slug, delivered, already_reviewed)
    API-->>Web: 200 ReviewEligibilityOut

    alt delivered AND brand_slug AND NOT already_reviewed
        Web->>Guest: Render inline GuestReviewPanel (rating + optional body)
        Guest->>Web: Pick stars, submit
        Web->>API: POST /reviews {order_id, brand_slug, rating, body?}<br/>Authorization: Guest {jwt}<br/>X-Guest-Email: {email}<br/>Idempotency-Key
        API->>Auth: resolve_request_actor(request, db)
        Auth-->>API: RequestActor(user_id=None, guest_email=email)
        API->>Svc: create_review(user_id=None, guest_email=email, order_id, brand_slug, rating, body)
        Svc->>DB: load order (guest_email matches? delivered? contains brand?)
        alt not owner / not delivered / brand not in order
            Svc-->>API: ForbiddenError (403)
        else eligible
            Svc->>DB: INSERT review (published, guest_email set, user_id NULL)<br/>[UNIQUE order_id, brand_id]
            alt already reviewed
                DB-->>Svc: IntegrityError
                Svc-->>API: ConflictError 409 already_reviewed
            else new
                Svc->>DB: SELECT brand_rating_stats FOR UPDATE
                Svc->>DB: bump count / sum / avg / histogram
                Svc-->>API: Review
                API-->>Web: 201 ReviewOut {author_name: null}
                Web->>Guest: Show thanks state
            end
        end
    else not eligible
        note over Web: Panel renders nothing (no CTA, no failed POST)
    end
